+## 18. Subconscious Inquiry Dreaming & Gravitational Tension Queue
+
+Subconscious processing during nightly `DORMANT` states or voluntary sleep cycles uses a **Gravitational Tension Queue**:
+- **Binding Gravity Sorting:** Belief clusters are evaluated in 8D space by mean pairwise binding gravity ($\vec{g}$). The highest-density clusters are prioritized, capped at the top 5 candidates.
+- **Subconscious Reflection Inquiries:** The Curator poses targeted subconscious inquiries (*"What information can be gleaned, or what conclusions, if any, can be drawn from the following belief fragments?"*) instead of simple summary requests.
+- **Meta-Prefix Sanitization:** Output parsing automatically strips preamble text (`"what information can be gleaned is..."`) to store pure conceptual realizations in Layer 2.
+
